share_pct":null}],"summary_long":"先進光從事光學鏡片與鏡頭研發、製造，產品應用涵蓋筆記型電腦及車載設備。2025年前三季合併財報中，光學部門外部收入為19.21億元，電子零組件部門為13.04億元。筆電鏡頭具名客戶包括DELL、HP、Lenovo、Apple及ASUS；車用既有客戶包括Volvo。集團透過科雅光電發展指紋辨識及觸控板系統模組，耀崴科技則經營車用產品。公司亦有機器人鏡頭出貨，並研發CPO相關V型槽與MT插芯，相關產品於2026年9月仍處驗證階段。重大交易包括2024年向台灣康寧顯示玻璃購廠，以及2026年處分科雅10%股權予八方國際投資，處分後仍持有科雅90%股權。","summary_short":"研製筆電、車載等光學鏡頭，並透過子公司經營指紋辨識與觸控模組。","tax_id":"22301825","themes":[{"also":[],"stage":"components","theme":"theme.robotics","tier":"upstream"},{"also":[],"stage":"components","theme":"theme.cpo","tier":"upstream"}],"top_customers":[{"as_of":"2024-09-09","confidence":"ai_cross_checked","counterparty_shares":[],"detail":"筆記型電腦鏡頭","details":["筆記型電腦鏡頭"],"edge":"e5bed27fae172","evidence_level":"media","id":"hk.0992","name":"Lenovo Group Ltd.","ranking_basis":"unranked","share_basis":null,"share_pct":null,"weight":1},{"as_of":"2026-01-05","confidence":"ai_cross_checked","counterparty_shares":[],"detail":"車用產品","details":["車用產品"],"edge":"e59aa9562f8f5","evidence_level":"media","id":"org.volvo","name":"Volvo","ranking_basis":"unranked","share_basis":null,"share_pct":null,"weight":1},{"as_of":"2024-09-09","confidence":"ai_cross_checked","counterparty_shares":[],"detail":"筆記型電腦鏡頭","details":["筆記型電腦鏡頭"],"edge":"e2e5401ed767e","evidence_level":"media","id":"tw.2357","name":"華碩","ranking_basis":"unranked","share_basis":null,"share_pct":null,"weight":1},{"as_of":"2024-09-09","confidence":"ai_cross_checked","counterparty_shares":[],"detail":"筆記型電腦鏡頭","details":["筆記型電腦鏡頭"],"edge":"e9830e58aebcb","evidence_level":"media","id":"us.AAPL","name":"Apple","ranking_basis":"unranked","share_basis":null,"share_pct":null,"weight":1},{"as_of":"2024-09-09","confidence":"ai_cross_checked","counterparty_shares":[],"detail":"筆記型電腦鏡頭","details":["筆記型電腦鏡頭"],"edge":"ea28a469768e6","evidence_level":"media","id":"us.DELL","name":"Dell","ranking_basis":"unranked","share_basis":null,"share_pct":null,"weight":1}],"top_suppliers":[],"unresolved_mentions":["機器人鏡頭的美系客戶：董事長未具名確認，不將媒體所稱亞馬遜或